## 6. Three-Tier Evaluation Framework & Metrics

We evaluate performance using standard statistical metrics, symbolic exact-matches, and **DeepEval** metrics:

| Level | Component | Evaluation Metric | Tool / Formula | Target Threshold |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :---: |
| **L1** | Intake Entities (G1) | Token F1 & Exact Match | `scikit-learn` / Python | Entity F1 $\ge 0.95$, EM $\ge 0.98$ |
| **L1** | Clause RAG (G2) | `ContextualPrecisionMetric`<br>`ContextualRecallMetric` | **DeepEval** | Precision $\ge 0.90$<br>Recall $\ge 0.95$ |
| **L1** | Clinical Extraction (G3) | `FaithfulnessMetric`<br>Checklist Accuracy | **DeepEval**<br>$\frac{\text{Correct Checks}}{\text{Total Checks}}$ | Faithfulness $\ge 0.95$<br>Checklist Acc $\ge 0.90$ |
